  "integration": [
    "Eliminate standalone normalization Cargo package and integrate normalization algorithms as private zxs-naming::unicode module.",
    "Rewrite algorithm crate-relative imports and rustdoc references to nested module; use naming std/alloc environment instead of removed package feature switches.",
    "Keep original normalization regression tests and persisted-key equivalence tests; key_profile baseline uses naming profiling API rather than private Unicode internals.",
    "Replace original unchecked Hangul scalar conversions with checked char::from_u32, preserving naming forbid(unsafe_code) and valid Unicode outputs.",
